Threads OAuth linking, status, disconnection, and text publication are implemented.
See web/README.md for Meta app configuration, permissions, token handling, and failure recovery.

Routes:
GET authorize?teamId=... — begin the authenticated OAuth flow
GET authorize/callback — validate state, exchange code, and save the team connection
GET getUserInfo?teamId=... — safe connection status (never returns a token)
DELETE getUserInfo?teamId=... — remove the saved connection
POST publish — { teamId, msgId, answer }; publish once and save the answer/link
